  "description": "Commander, black and red, based on the list \"Tevesh Szat + Jeska - My Demonic Signature Deck\" by Kronic_EDH_Vet (Moxfield, bracket 4: four Game Changers, Demonic Tutor, Vampiric Tutor, Mana Vault and Jeska's Will). Two partner commanders, Tevesh Szat, Doom of Fools and Jeska, Thrice Reborn: big Demons (Abyssal Persecutor, Bloodthirster, Orcus, Rakdos, Razaketh, Reaper from the Abyss) brought back from the graveyard (Animate Dead, Reanimate, Dread Return, Buried Alive, Entomb), sacrifice (Grave Pact, Ashnod's Altar, Skullclamp) and board wipes (Blasphemous Act, Hellfire, Kindred Dominance).",
